
Files included in this SRE to Trek Realms conversion kit:
RESOURCE.DAT - Trek resource file
TRANSLAT.DAT - Trek translation file
TITLE.ANS    - Title screen
README!.1ST  - This file

Just add this resource option into your main RESOURCE.DAT:

Flavor                  "Trek"

and put the above files in the FLAVORS\TREK subdirectory.

And, let me know what you think! You can leave E-mail for me at the
Solar Realms BBS  (713) 855-1665  (to "Rattur")
or call my board, Peoria's On-Line Game Domain (309) 688-7242 and E-mail
me there! Enjoy!

